    "description": "Natural Azurite & Malachite Specimen\nRaw Mineral Display Rock\nNatural Mineral, Approximately 5.5 Inches, 2.05 Pounds\nThis natural geological specimen showcases vibrant royal blue botryoidal azurite formations intergrown with rich green malachite across a dark gossan rock matrix. Azurite and malachite are secondary copper carbonate minerals prized for their intense coloration and contrasting visual texture. Specimens featuring intact crystal vugs and natural matrix presentation make exceptional display pieces for mineral collectors and natural history enthusiasts.\nFeatures deep blue botryoidal azurite nodules and bright green malachite deposits\nSolid natural matrix with exposed crystal vug on front face\nMeasures approximately 5.5 inches tall by 5 inches wide by 3 inches deep\nWeight: approximately 2.05 pounds (2 lbs 1 oz)\nCondition:\nNatural rough mineral specimen in as-found unpolished condition. Crystal pockets show sharp natural formations and vibrant color with no visible artificial treatment or repair. Matrix is stable with typical natural fracturing and minor crumb shedding inherent to raw mineral rock.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
